lity and supply options."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you help us select the right ingredient?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Share your application, expected function, required grade and quantity. The team can help identify suitable product options for evaluation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we request product specifications or certificates?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Product specifications and supporting documents can be requested. Availability depends on the selected ingredient and manufacturer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you support bulk ingredient requirements?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Vikranth primarily supports manufacturers, bakeries, food processors and other professional buyers. Mention your approximate quantity when requesting a quotation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What information is needed for a quotation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Provide the ingredient name, grade or application, required quantity, delivery location, company name and contact information."}}]}]0:{"P":null,"b":"A6c-HerznHYaiUN3tBlyY","p":"","c":["","_not-found",""],"i":false,"f":[[["",{"children":["/_not-found",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/1051394a7758ee4b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/e050c511a6c78f7c.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","children":["$","body",null,{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L3",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","forbidden":"$undefined","unauthorized":"$undefined"}],["$","script",null,{